headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
}

docs {
  ## Me — Get authenticated user profile

  Protected endpoint. Requires a valid JWT token in the `Authorization` header.
  The token is automatically injected from the `authToken` variable (set by Login or Signup).

  ### Headers
  | Header        | Value               | Required |
  |---------------|---------------------|----------|
  | Authorization | Bearer {{authToken}}| ✅       |

  ### Success Response (200)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "user": {
        "id": "uuid",
        "email": "abir@example.com",
        "name": "Abir Hasan",
        "username": "hasan-452187",
        "role": "USER",
        "student_id": "2023-123-456",
        "department": "uuid"
      }
    }
  }
  ```

  ### Error Responses
  - **401** — Missing/invalid/expired token
  - **404** — Profile not found
}
